        <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">rk</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">ans</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span><span class="c1">//右指针，初始值为 -1，相当于我们在字符串的左边界的左侧，还没有开始移动</span>
